TI  - Distributional impacts of behavioral effects – ex-ante evaluation of the 2017 unemployment insurance reform in Finland
AU  - Kotamäki, Mauri
AU  - Mattila, Jukka
AU  - Tervola, Jussi
VL  - 11
IS  - 2
PY  - 2018
DA  - 2018/08/31
